  "limitations": [
    "Acceptance restricted to governance/authoring; no Rust compilation, Iced integration or product effectiveness.",
    "Executor review is not independent human review; historical trials were not rerun.",
    "Previous envelopes are in docs/validation/governance-layout/before.tar.gz; collection outputs are checked separately through freshness and final extraction.",
    "Initial package qualification has its own inputs preceding consolidation; the final delivery receipt is in dist/.",
    "The skills' 36 technical scenarios remain UNVERIFIED.",
    "maintenance-001: affected observations are preserved in docs/validation/maintenance-001/previous/sdd/features/skill-agent-usage-accounting/evidence.json.bin; awaiting review or new execution without renewing old hashes.",
    "maintenance-001 observations are new; previous results are preserved. Actual-package criteria, a new agent trial and unresolved ownership/permissions remain UNVERIFIED.",
    "Inputs changed by bootstrap; previous observations and historical approvals are preserved in docs/validation/bootstrap-governance/previous. Dependent criteria await their own reacceptance; old hashes were not renewed.",
    "2026-11-01: new criterion review at docs/validation/skill-criteria-review-20261101/matrix.json. Technical observations do not automatically promote formal AC-01..04 under the existing guard; no product expansion. AC-06 reexamines historical replies, not new agents.",
    "2026-11-01 technical-acceptance supersedes the former unconditional guard. Decided technical criteria concern frozen evaluated consumers only; semantic review and original limits remain mandatory.",
    "2026-11-01 pending-criterion execution: only bounded evaluated consumers are accepted. Full scopes, failures and positive/negative controls in skill-consumers-20261101; product adoption remains independent. Existing AC-05/06 retain historical-response review, not new agent trials.",
    "2026-11-01 documentary reconciliation: old input digests preserved under explicit snapshot paths; new task/successor inspections do not represent operational reruns. See docs/validation/f0-reconciliation-20261101/dependency-impact.json."
  ]
}
